  _moduleName: "Neo.Rpg \xB7 Vampire Survivor (3D)"
  _purpose: 'First-person survival arena: three Spawner waves of RpgCharacter enemies
    chase the player through NpcNavigation while the AuraWeapon damages everything
    close.'
  _runtimeApi: Spawner.StartSpawn / StopSpawn / OnObjectSpawned, RpgCharacter.DamageType
    / Restore / OnDeathEvent, NpcNavigation.SetFollowTarget.
  _sceneWorkflow: 'first Person Controller: PlayerController3DPhysics + RpgCharacter
    + AuraWeapon; WaveSpawner_1..3: Spawner; controller: VampireSurvivorDemoController
    + RpgWorldHealthBars.'
  _verification: Enemies spawn and chase; Damage Player until YOU DIED appears; Reset
    Run restores.
  _showRuntimeOverlay: 1
  _corner: 1
